  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Cut Malaysian tofu into 2cm chunks. Thinly slice long chilli (if using).\n• In a small bowl, combine satay seasoning, garlic paste and a splash of water.\n• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook tofu, tossing, until browned, 3-4 minutes. Transfer to a bowl and cover to keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66308a8b617c8a08b401a0bf-01b7ced9.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return saucepan to high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook carrot & zucchini mix, tossing, until slightly tender, 2-3 minutes.\n• Add satay mixture and cook, stirring, until fragrant, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66308a8b617c8a08b401a0bf-7e05d9ab.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Reduce heat to medium-high and stir in the boiling water (2 cups for 2 people / 4 cups for 4 people), coconut milk and the soy sauce.\n• Add egg noodles, then reduce to a simmer and cover with a lid.\n• Cook until noodles are tender, 4-5 minutes. In the last minute, gently stir noodles with a fork to separate.\n• Remove from heat, then stir through baby spinach leaves and sweet chilli sauce, until combined and wilted.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66308a8b617c8a08b401a0bf-567d0207.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Serve coconut noodle soup between bowls.\n• Top with satay-style tofu and chilli to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66308a8b617c8a08b401a0bf-0bc09b95.jpeg"
    }
  ]
